          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Will the quote match my prices?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. It works only from the rates you give us, and anything unusual is left for you to price."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can it handle repeat clients?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes: reminders and rebooking for weekly and monthly clients, with changes passed to you."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does it reply by itself?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Only if you want it to. We start with drafts you send in one tap; routine answers can go out by themselves later."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do I still need a website?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Not to start. A site with an instant quote tool is an add-on from R12,500."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Who will we deal with?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A small studio: the person on your free call builds it and answers your messages, with no call centre or hand-offs. It’s documented and runs in accounts you own, so any developer can pick it up."
